    {
      "id": "u_ec5e5b48811b6a6763dbfbd3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A custom resource provider allows any file imported into Trilium (images, fonts, stylesheets) to be publicly accessible via a URL.",
      "sourceHash": "ec5e5b48811b6a6763dbfbd3f942cbdaaf722884756d27a878b6872a7dcb8aaf",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers",
      "contextHash": "0736d73f9ad0122426b0f09b547e51fac54c87890ea1a035126e807d5a20fc5d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "カスタムリソースプロバイダーを使用すると、Trilium にインポートされた任意のファイル（画像、フォント、スタイルシートなど）を URL 経由で一般公開できるようになります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bd4044c8e1aadfe06d0c0f1b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A potential use case for this is to add embed a custom font alongside a theme.",
      "sourceHash": "bd4044c8e1aadfe06d0c0f1b96bb2b17174f580d773fd30c79fd856176344f13",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers",
      "contextHash": "0736d73f9ad0122426b0f09b547e51fac54c87890ea1a035126e807d5a20fc5d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これの一般的なユースケースとしては、テーマと一緒にカスタムフォントを埋め込むことが挙げられます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
