      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_131390b76b36f310ef5a67b7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Import a file such as an image or a font into Trilium by drag & drop.",
      "sourceHash": "131390b76b36f310ef5a67b7c995cad8c6299c8742c11e4fd69a251b5628ace7",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers > Steps for creating a custom resource provider",
      "contextHash": "8ca761a95781c36b94e4b22c31588b6d7ca6cd171c53ca28166b007ea45796d5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "画像やフォントなどのファイルをドラッグ＆ドロップで Trilium にインポートします。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f1d0e5aac41925d2cd8c5148_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Set the __TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__ to __TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "f1d0e5aac41925d2cd8c5148f2b0b0620c8c503c7f5472ca1019c265ea6b6ce4",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers > Steps for creating a custom resource provider",
      "contextHash": "8ca761a95781c36b94e4b22c31588b6d7ca6cd171c53ca28166b007ea45796d5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__ を __TRILIUM_PH_3__ に設定します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_44276928e613f12a5731159a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To test if it is working, use a browser to navigate to __TRILIUM_PH_0__ (where __TRILIUM_PH_1__ is either __TRILIUM_PH_2__ or __TRILIUM_PH_3__ based on your setup, and __TRILIUM_PH_4__ is the host or IP to your Trilium server instance). If you are running the TriliumNext application without a server, use __TRILIUM_PH_5__ as the base URL.",
      "sourceHash": "44276928e613f12a5731159a0c1aa937e79a04025043b466bf4f1f729d51f339",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers > Steps for creating a custom resource provider",
      "contextHash": "8ca761a95781c36b94e4b22c31588b6d7ca6cd171c53ca28166b007ea45796d5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "動作しているかテストするには、ブラウザで __TRILIUM_PH_0__ にアクセスします（ここで、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ はセットアップに応じて __TRILIUM_PH_2__ または __TRILIUM_PH_3__ のいずれかであり、__TRILIUM_PH_4__ は Trilium サーバーインスタンスのホストまたは IP です）。サーバーなしで TriliumNext アプリケーションを実行している場合は、ベース URL として __TRILIUM_PH_5__ を使用してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_da010aa6f8b98e3650592ad0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If everything went well, at the previous step the browser should have downloaded the file uploaded in the first step.",
      "sourceHash": "da010aa6f8b98e3650592ad0b1404b526c17a7619254d576bbabab6c37ab9fcb",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers > Steps for creating a custom resource provider",
      "contextHash": "8ca761a95781c36b94e4b22c31588b6d7ca6cd171c53ca28166b007ea45796d5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "すべてが順調にいっていれば、前の手順でブラウザは最初の手順でアップロードされたファイルをダウンロードするはずです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e4e10f02e42caaff0bd5dcf8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Instead of __TRILIUM_PH_0__, the name can be:",
      "sourceHash": "e4e10f02e42caaff0bd5dcf84b797549f83cc8fc6e622693ba29a4d0d00fdf8f",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers > Steps for creating a custom resource provider",
      "contextHash": "8ca761a95781c36b94e4b22c31588b6d7ca6cd171c53ca28166b007ea45796d5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ の代わりに、次のような名前にすることもできます:",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9c5a4610dac0d3a604d80fb2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A path, such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__, which would be accessible via __TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "9c5a4610dac0d3a604d80fb2fbac872869868d9dcb19e18fb04dee1ce9777862",
      "context": "Custom Resource Providers > Steps for creating a custom resource provider",
      "contextHash": "8ca761a95781c36b94e4b22c31588b6d7ca6cd171c53ca28166b007ea45796d5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ のようなパスを指定すると、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ 経由でアクセスできるようになります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2987ce5d68d721265b96710a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "As a more advanced use case, a regular expression to match multiple routes, such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__ which will be accessible via __TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__, __TRILIUM_PH_3__, etc.",
